<div class="WordSection1"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight about a quote for domestic cargo.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
There are a number of different options for sending freight with Qantas, each with different levels of service and support.<br />
<br />
Our most popular products include:<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b>Q-GO Priority</b> – <span style="color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">when an urgent delivery is required. Ensuring your goods are 'prioritised' above all other cargo.&nbsp;</span><br />
<b>Q-GO Express</b> –&nbsp; <span style="color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">when your goods need to move a bit faster than usual, we can offer ‘express’ handling, both on the ground and in the air. Ideal for fulfilling online orders speedily.</span><br />
<b>Q-GO Classic</b> – <span style="color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">when reliable, cost effective delivery is more than sufficient. Ideal for large scale shipments and supply chains that are time critical but not urgent.</span><br />
<b>Q-GO Fresh</b> –&nbsp; <span style="color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">The perfect service for all perishable goods, fresh produce, flowers and plants; when maintaining the quality of your goods matters.</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
More information on our products and services can be found on our airfreight services page <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/freight-services/air-freight.html">here</a>.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
When you're ready to get a quote or make a booking, the quickest and easiest way is via <a href="https://www.qantas.com.au/qfreight/qfe/shipment-registration-wizard/global/en">qantasfreight.com</a> . You'll be able to compare options and quotes.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Remember to have the dimensions and weight of your shipment handy as you'll need those to get a quote.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thanks for your interest in Qantas Freight.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;
